scrcpy-server
-------------
The low-latency capture source (see src/host/source/scrcpy/) pushes a
`scrcpy-server` jar to the device and speaks its socket protocol. When a jar is
bundled it lives at vendor/scrcpy-server-<version> and is an unmodified binary
redistribution of the server component of scrcpy.

